elin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6612924/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか発表があるの？\nみなさんのコメント読んで知った(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これよくあることなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーもいろんな発表を乃木坂のHPから知る\n＝ファンのみなさんと同じタイミングで知れる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいことだね(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、発表はなんのことだ〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず見ましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6612924/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-27006":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわむら まひろです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/12/08/4432939/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はLIVEの準備で毎日毎日メンバーと一緒なのに，，， 写真を撮るタイミングがなくて（ノ`）・゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさぁい♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しく購入した紫のトレーナー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色がおしゃれだなぁと思いつい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/